    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Put them in a bowl with the coarse salt and rub hard for 1–2 minutes, until a grey foam comes up.</li><li>Run your fingers down each tentacle to clean the suckers.</li><li>Rinse well under running water until the surface feels slightly rough, not slimy.</li></ul>",
