     "name_html": "Coarse salt (for cleaning)"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Cut all the cleaned octopus into <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"1\" data-s=\"0\">1 cm</span> pieces. Keep the whole batch for separate tender-cooking; none goes into the rice cooker.</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
