  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Heat neutral oil in a <span class=\"q\" data-k=\"len\" data-u=\"cm\" data-a=\"26\" data-s=\"0\">26 cm</span> pan over medium-high heat. Add the dry tender octopus in one uncrowded layer; work in batches if necessary.</li><li>Leave briefly to develop browned edges, then turn: about 2–3 minutes total. Do not keep frying to fix tough octopus; it should already be tender. Transfer to a clean plate.</li></ul>",
