  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Put the warm cooked rice in a wide bowl. Add only the drained coated octopus pieces and finely sliced green onion. Do not pour in cooking liquor or leftover glaze.</li><li>Cut and fold gently with the rice paddle so pieces spread through without crushing the grains. A few local brown marks are normal; the rice was never cooked in purple octopus broth.</li><li>Cool only until comfortable to handle, then divide the entire mixture into six equal portions.</li></ul>",
