   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Wet and lightly salt your hands. Shape each of the six equal portions gently into a triangle, keeping the rice airy.</li><li>Add the selected nori wrapping just before eating. Remove all cling film before serving.</li></ul>",
